{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Twilight Ferry is an adventure game inspired by the old epics of Finnic mythology.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every lost soul needs a guide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Someone is waiting\u2014someone only <strong>You</strong> can save.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>If they forgot their past, forgot your face, forgot every moment you shared\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Would you still stay?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tuoni\u2014God of Death\u2014plans to wipe out humanity from the face of the earth. Tytti, an emotionally limited Ferrymaiden, possesses the power to stop him but needs help to discover it. You see Tytti lose all her memories due to a curse by Tuoni. Her journey would be over, if <strong>You</strong> had not been there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/7472b08c9766f5df5d4a35d687384c9d.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/7472b08c9766f5df5d4a35d687384c9d.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/7472b08c9766f5df5d4a35d687384c9d.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Tytti to master human emotions, navigate the underworld's challenges, and ultimately confront Tuoni. As you help her to recover her lost memories, Tytti grows more capable and courageous, gaining strength to overcome the obstacles in her path and restore balance in the cycle of rebirth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the creatures and personalities along the river that separates the underworld from the material realm. Shamans, spirits\u2026 and Mushroomfolk? Traverse hidden grottos in search of answers, and to free souls of the deceased who are stuck in limbo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c68cce12671b29035e9e2fca046c0ec2.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c68cce12671b29035e9e2fca046c0ec2.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c68cce12671b29035e9e2fca046c0ec2.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotion Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Tytti focus by changing her emotions through <i>Meditation</i>. Each emotion offers different dialogue options and abilities to traverse the world. Be wary of Tytti\u2019s mood\u2014it can make her act impulsively if left unchecked!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c959615c658cc6e945ca79e8f5d6f4b5.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c959615c658cc6e945ca79e8f5d6f4b5.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c959615c658cc6e945ca79e8f5d6f4b5.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll confront not only external enemies but also the depths of Tytti\u2019s own emotional struggles. Manage Tytti's emotions correctly to solve puzzles and beat adversaries in the ancient rite of<i> Spellsinging</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/ad3d1d1aa6bc120b95d4bc90e8b101c3.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/ad3d1d1aa6bc120b95d4bc90e8b101c3.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/ad3d1d1aa6bc120b95d4bc90e8b101c3.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A tranquil audiovisual experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an unique visual style combining 2D pixel art with a fully lit 3D environment, together with a &quot;beautifully eerie&quot; soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3141870?t=1767978604","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3141870?t=1767978604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/547d4cdad83e4ed427863c9bb055c6bcf7de1889/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767978604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/547d4cdad83e4ed427863c9bb055c6bcf7de1889/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767978604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4265470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Twilight Ferry is an adventure game inspired by the old epics of Finnic mythology.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every lost soul needs a guide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Someone is waiting\u2014someone only <strong>You</strong> can save.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>If they forgot their past, forgot your face, forgot every moment you shared\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Would you still stay?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tuoni\u2014God of Death\u2014plans to wipe out humanity from the face of the earth. Tytti, an emotionally limited Ferrymaiden, possesses the power to stop him but needs help to discover it. You see Tytti lose all her memories due to a curse by Tuoni. Her journey would be over, if <strong>You</strong> had not been there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/7472b08c9766f5df5d4a35d687384c9d.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/7472b08c9766f5df5d4a35d687384c9d.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/7472b08c9766f5df5d4a35d687384c9d.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Tytti to master human emotions, navigate the underworld's challenges, and ultimately confront Tuoni. As you help her to recover her lost memories, Tytti grows more capable and courageous, gaining strength to overcome the obstacles in her path and restore balance in the cycle of rebirth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the creatures and personalities along the river that separates the underworld from the material realm. Shamans, spirits\u2026 and Mushroomfolk? Traverse hidden grottos in search of answers, and to free souls of the deceased who are stuck in limbo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c68cce12671b29035e9e2fca046c0ec2.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c68cce12671b29035e9e2fca046c0ec2.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c68cce12671b29035e9e2fca046c0ec2.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotion Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Tytti focus by changing her emotions through <i>Meditation</i>. Each emotion offers different dialogue options and abilities to traverse the world. Be wary of Tytti\u2019s mood\u2014it can make her act impulsively if left unchecked!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c959615c658cc6e945ca79e8f5d6f4b5.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c959615c658cc6e945ca79e8f5d6f4b5.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/c959615c658cc6e945ca79e8f5d6f4b5.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll confront not only external enemies but also the depths of Tytti\u2019s own emotional struggles. Manage Tytti's emotions correctly to solve puzzles and beat adversaries in the ancient rite of<i> Spellsinging</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/ad3d1d1aa6bc120b95d4bc90e8b101c3.poster.avif?t=1767978604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/ad3d1d1aa6bc120b95d4bc90e8b101c3.webm?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/extras/ad3d1d1aa6bc120b95d4bc90e8b101c3.mp4?t=1767978604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A tranquil audiovisual experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an unique visual style combining 2D pixel art with a fully lit 3D environment, together with a &quot;beautifully eerie&quot; soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lakeside Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/header.jpg?t=1767978604","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.5 (Catalina) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li><