"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe mix of the slightly gloomy music along with the graphics creates an atmosphere like I've only seen in a handful of games.\u201d<br>itch.io User<br><br>\u201cThe demo intrigued and delighted me with its fresh approach on familiar genres. I loved the otherwordly vibe of the world, and the sneak peek into the bigger plot and cast of characters. I'm very interested to see what the journey to the other side will end up looking like.\u201d<br>itch.io User<br><br>\u201cTuoni is so hot.\u201d<br>Demo playtester<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/c4e28c9d8328155f6d92384c43818c6c2a7de8a8/ss_c4e28c9d8328155f6d92384c43818c6c2a7de8a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767978604","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/c4e28c9d8328155f6d92384c43818c6c2a7de8a8/ss_c4e28c9d8328155f6d92384c43818c6c2a7de8a8.600x338.jpg?t=1767978604"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/b3123d4f648c33e4840340989ace5909f5752d4d/ss_b3123d4f648c33e4840340989ace5909f5752d4d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767978604","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/b3123d4f648c33e4840340989ace5909f5752d4d/ss_b3123d4f648c33e4840340989ace5909f5752d4d.600x338.jpg?t=1767978604"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141870/7d3ec1aaccb21b9b24a3b3518a6a84772e23ab82/ss_7d3ec1aaccb21b9b24a3b3518a6a84772e23ab82.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767978604","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst